    "name": "Darts VR 2: Bullseye",
    "steam_appid": 2873180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darts VR2: Bullseye</strong> is the next evolution of immersive darts gameplay, bringing <strong>precision, competition, and casual fun</strong> to virtual reality. Whether you're aiming for the <strong>championship trophy</strong>, battling <strong>zombie hordes</strong>, mastering <strong>501 Mode</strong>, or just <strong>throwing darts for fun</strong>, this game has something for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete &amp; Conquer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against friends or challenge the world in high-stakes <strong>esports tournaments</strong>. Win <strong>championships, host your own competitions</strong>, and prove your dominance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the 501 Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast, aim sharp, and <strong>strategize your way to exactly zero</strong> before your opponent. A true test of skill, patience, and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Undead</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a thrilling <strong>Zombies Mode</strong>, where each throw could mean survival or defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual or Competitive? Your Choice!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're <strong>practicing trick shots, hitting impossible killstreaks</strong>, or just relaxing with a few rounds, there's always a way to enjoy the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn achievements, <strong>hone your skills</strong>, and rise to the top. Show off your darts collection, unlockable cosmetics, and unique avatars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cross-Platform Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>friends across different VR devices</strong>, including <strong>Meta Quest, Rift S, PSVR 2, HTC Vive, and more</strong>. No matter what hardware you use, the game brings everyone together.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darts VR2: Bullseye</strong> is the next evolution of immersive darts gameplay, bringing <strong>precision, competition, and casual fun</strong> to virtual reality. Whether you're aiming for the <strong>championship trophy</strong>, battling <strong>zombie hordes</strong>, mastering <strong>501 Mode</strong>, or just <strong>throwing darts for fun</strong>, this game has something for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete &amp; Conquer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against friends or challenge the world in high-stakes <strong>esports tournaments</strong>. Win <strong>championships, host your own competitions</strong>, and prove your dominance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the 501 Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast, aim sharp, and <strong>strategize your way to exactly zero</strong> before your opponent. A true test of skill, patience, and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Undead</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a thrilling <strong>Zombies Mode</strong>, where each throw could mean survival or defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual or Competitive? Your Choice!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're <strong>practicing trick shots, hitting impossible killstreaks</strong>, or just relaxing with a few rounds, there's always a way to enjoy the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn achievements, <strong>hone your skills</strong>, and rise to the top. Show off your darts collection, unlockable cosmetics, and unique avatars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cross-Platform Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>friends across different VR devices</strong>, including <strong>Meta Quest, Rift S, PSVR 2, HTC Vive, and more</strong>. No matter what hardware you use, the game brings everyone together.</p>",
    "short_description": "The thrilling world of Darts VR awaits! Compete in multiple modes, challenge friends in multiplayer, and test your skills against zombies in an action-packed mode. Whether aiming for the bullseye or battling the undead, Darts VR offers endless fun and excitement. Aim, throw and dominate the world!",
